## Inventory boundaries

The original inventory contains 130 project/research/report/rule documents outside archived copies, 71 candidate-tree documents, three frozen-protocol/backup documents, four golden-fixture documents, and one tool-cache README. Its [machine-readable record](../reports/project-understanding-20261105/markdown-inventory-before.json) pins every path, size, SHA-256 and heading list. It does not include new documents created by this consolidation.

Inventorying a file is not a claim of independent semantic review of every line. Owning documents/code and the three chat histories were reconciled in detail; duplicates, output transcripts and immutable protocols are cataloged according to their role. No blind packet sources, human answers or sealed predictions were opened for this task.

