## Keeping this consolidation useful

Update START-HERE only when the architecture or product semantics change. Update BUILD-STATUS when a milestone or blocker changes, preserving source links and capture dates. Append actual work to PROGRESS. Change SPEC before behavior changes. Keep historical reports, goldens, frozen protocols and candidate copies intact. Add new documents to a later inventory rather than changing the meaning of this dated 209-file baseline.

